stream
BT
/F1 14 Tf 18 TL 40 750 Td (QUY DINH PHUONG THUC THANH TOAN SHOPEE VIETNAM) '
/F2 9 Tf 12 TL (Target Customer Role: both) '
(Document Identifier: phuong-thuc-thanh-toan) '
(Effective Date: 2026-01-01 | Version: 2.4 | Status: Active) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (1. GENERAL PROVISIONS ON PAYMENT METHODS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Van ban nay quy dinh tat ca cac phuong thuc thanh toan hop le, quy trinh xu ly giao dich) '
(va quy dinh bao mat tai chinh cho ca Nguoi mua va Nguoi ban khi giao dich tren Shopee Vietnam.) '
(Tat ca cac giao dich thanh toan tren Shopee deu phai thuc hien thong qua he thong thanh toan) '
(chinh thuc cua Shopee de dam bao an toan va duoc bao ve boi Shopee Guarantee. Nghiem cam moi) '
(hanh vi thoa thuan thanh toan ngoai nen tang (off-platform payment).) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (2. PAYMENT OPTIONS AVAILABLE FOR BUYERS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Shopee ho tro nhieu phuong thuc thanh toan linh hoat va an toan cho Nguoi mua bao gom:) '
(a) Thanh toan khi nhan hang (COD - Cash On Delivery): Nguoi mua thanh toan tien mat cho) '
(nhan vien giao hang khi nhan kien hang. Ap dung cho hau het cac khu vuc va danh muc.) '
(b) Vi dien tu ShopeePay: Phuong thuc thanh toan dien tu nhan uu dai ma giam gia, mien phi) '
(van chuyen va hoan tien nhanh. Yeu cau nap tien tu tai khoan ngan hang lien ket.) '
(c) The Tin dung / The Ghi no (Credit / Debit Card): Ho tro cac the Visa, Mastercard, JCB,) '
(American Express phat hanh boi cac ngan hang hop phap. Giao dich duoc ma hoa 3D-Secure.) '
(d) Chuyen khoan Ngan hang / QR Code: Nguoi mua quet ma VietQR hoac chuyen khoan den tai khoan) '
(dinh danh cua Shopee de xac nhan don hang tu dong trong vong 5 phut.) '
(e) SPayLater (Mua truoc tra sau): Dich vu tin dung duoc cung cap boi doi tac ngan hang cua) '
(Shopee, cho phep Nguoi mua chia nho khoan thanh toan thanh 1, 3, 6 hoac 12 ky han.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (3. SELLER BALANCE MANAGEMENT & WITHDRAWALS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Quy dinh ve thanh toan va thu nhap danh cho Nguoi ban tren Shopee:) '
(- So du Tai khoan Shopee (Shopee Balance): So tien tu cac don hang hoan tat se duoc ghi co) '
(vao So du Tai khoan Shopee cua Nguoi ban sau khi tru cac khoan phi dich vu va phi giao dich.) '
(- Rut tien tu dong (Auto Withdrawal): Nguoi ban co the thiet lap lich rut tien tu dong hang) '
(tuan (vao thu 3) hoac hang thang (ngay 1 va 15) ve tai khoan ngan hang chinh thuc.) '
(- Rut tien thu cong (Manual Withdrawal): Nguoi ban co the gui yeu cau rut tien bat ky luc nao.) '
(Thoi gian xu ly chuyen tien tu 24h den 48h lam viec (khong tinh thu 7, chu nhat va ngay le).) '
(- Han muc rut tien: Moi tai khoan Nguoi ban duoc mien phi 01 lan rut tien thu cong moi ngay.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (4. TRANSACTION FEES AND PLATFORM COMMISSIONS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Nguoi ban va Nguoi mua phai tuan thu quy dinh ve cac khoan phi giao dich va phi nen tang:) '
(a) Phi giao dich (Transaction Fee): Phi tinh tren tong so tien thanh toan cua don hang) '
((bao gom tien hang va phi van chuyen). Muc phi hien tai la 3.0% - 4.0% tuy theo phuong thuc.) '
(b) Phi co dinh (Fixed Fee): Phi hoa hong nen tang ap dung cho tat ca cac don hang thanh cong) '
(cua Nguoi ban Shopee Mall va Nguoi ban thong thuong (tu 2.5% den 8.0% tuy danh muc nganh hang).) '
(c) Phi Dich vu (Service Fee): Ap dung cho Nguoi ban tham gia cac chuong trinh uu dai nhu) '
(Goi Freeship Xtra, Goi Voucher Xtra, hoac Chuong trinh Hoan Xu Xtra.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (5. TRANSACTION SECURITY AND ANTI-FRAUD MEASURES) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Doi voi an toan thanh toan va phong chong gian luan:) '
(- Shopee su dung he thong quan ly rui ro tu dong de phat hien cac giao dich bat thuong,) '
(su dung the tin dung gia, hoac co hanh vi spaming ma giam gia.) '
(- Moi hanh vi co tinh thuc hien giao dich khong hop le, rua tien, hoac gian luan thanh toan) '
(se bi khoa tai khoan vinh vien va chuyen ho so sang co quan chuc nang xu ly theo phap luat.) '
(- Shopee khong bao gio yeu cau Nguoi dung cung cap ma OTP, mat khau vi hoac so the tin dung) '
(qua dien thoai hay tin nhan ca nhan.) '
ET
